WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:16.264
Tina: Thanks for coming this far with us, Hopian.

2
00:00:16.265 --> 00:00:21.439
Hopian: The rest is up to you two. Good luck.

3
00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:23.720
Tina: Will I see you again?

4
00:00:23.721 --> 00:00:25.889
Hopian: You never know.

5
00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:33.272
The future is impossible to predict.

6
00:00:33.273 --> 00:00:36.175
Tina: I'll miss you.

7
00:00:36.176 --> 00:00:38.997
Hopian: I'll miss you too.

8
00:00:38.998 --> 00:00:42.336
Don't stay away too long, Bello.

9
00:00:42.337 --> 00:00:50.363
Hopian: Remember, time will flow faster for me while you're away. Bye.

10
00:00:50.364 --> 00:00:55.297
Bello: I'll see you soon, Dad.

11
00:00:55.298 --> 00:00:59.003
Tina: The mountain looks easier to climb now.

12
00:00:59.004 --> 00:01:02.383
Bello: Yes. We visit here all the time.

13
00:01:02.384 --> 00:01:04.932
The mountain is now a park.

14
00:01:04.933 --> 00:01:08.074
Tina: It looks like a long walk.

15
00:01:08.075 --> 00:01:10.437
Bello: Well, it's still a tall mountain.

16
00:01:10.438 --> 00:01:12.818
That hasn't changed.

17
00:01:12.819 --> 00:01:15.309
Tina: I guess we should get started.

18
00:01:15.310 --> 00:01:26.742
Bello: Here, let me help.

19
00:01:26.743 --> 00:01:29.759
Tina: Look. It's the vine Danny planted.

20
00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:35.184
Bello: Wait until you see the top.

21
00:01:35.185 --> 00:01:37.241
Look over there.

22
00:01:37.242 --> 00:01:42.281
Tina: Wow. That vine has really grown in fifteen years!

23
00:01:42.282 --> 00:01:44.403
Tina: Hey, there's the rainbow.

24
00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:46.845
It looks so close.

25
00:01:46.846 --> 00:01:51.079
Bello: Yes, but it's high in the sky.

26
00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:53.397
Tina: How will we get to it?

27
00:01:53.398 --> 00:01:58.608
Bello: We'll have to figure something out.

28
00:01:58.609 --> 00:02:02.239
Hmm . . . I think it could work.

29
00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:06.006
Tina: What are you thinking?

30
00:02:06.007 --> 00:02:12.334
Bello: Tina, go stand at the other end of the park.

31
00:02:12.335 --> 00:02:14.670
Tina: Okay. Now what?

32
00:02:14.671 --> 00:02:17.363
Bello: You said you were a good runner, Tina.

33
00:02:17.364 --> 00:02:19.015
Tina: That's right.

34
00:02:19.016 --> 00:02:30.785
Bello: Good. Run as fast as you can toward me.

35
00:02:30.786 --> 00:02:33.800
Tina: It worked! It worked!

36
00:02:33.801 --> 00:02:36.320
Bello: Great job, Tina.

37
00:02:36.321 --> 00:02:49.446
Tina: But how will you get up here?

38
00:02:49.447 --> 00:02:57.190
Bello: Now, tie it tight.

39
00:02:57.191 --> 00:02:58.979
Tina: You did it!

40
00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:00.764
Bello: It wasn't that hard.

41
00:03:00.765 --> 00:03:04.085
I used to climb on those vines when I was a kid.

42
00:03:04.086 --> 00:03:14.987
Tina: It's time to slide! Let's go!

43
00:03:14.988 --> 00:03:16.839
Bello: Where are we?

44
00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:18.504
Tina: This is perfect!

45
00:03:18.505 --> 00:03:23.172
We are right beside my house!

46
00:03:23.173 --> 00:03:24.939
Bello: Who's that?

47
00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:30.770
Tina: Um, that's my neighbor, Mrs. Rice.

48
00:03:30.771 --> 00:03:33.556
Bello: She's waving at me!

49
00:03:33.557 --> 00:03:42.218
Tina: I don't think she's waving.

50
00:03:42.219 --> 00:03:45.519
Bello: I don't think she is happy to see me.

51
00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:49.164
Tina: Uh-oh.
